      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Knowledge (the planes) 5 ranks, Spellcraft 5 ranks,</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once per day per point of your manifesting Ability Score modifier, you may expend your psionic focus as a swift action to make one Knowledge (the planes) check, about the plane you are currently on, that gains a +4 insight bonus.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc29\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
